[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_xjwt2")
text = "[b]Xavier’s Diary Entry 98.[/b] 
 
 It’s been a while since I’ve written in my diary, but I have to get my thoughts together and figure out what to do going forward.  
 
 I recently lost access to my bank account, which has led to my card being either deactivated or drained. I only had about 80 cloudbucks at home, which isn’t enough to cover my car's gas. I’m facing the possibility of losing my warehouse stocker job because I can't drive to my worksite. Not even one person can hitch me a ride?!  
 
 The worst part is that fucking bank doesn’t believe it’s me. So they’ve cut off all communication with my IP and won’t respond. 
 
 I have no choice but to ask for a refund from my friend for that TV… 
 
 I also swear that I saw somebody watching me through the window..."
